The three of these are symptoms of heart disease. The reason you are dizzier is because you have high blood pressure, but this is not an emergency. You can get treatment for your high BP. Your pulse can be elevated because of the heart or it can just be your resting pulse. As for the weight, if you gain weight in your heart, your blood vessels will become more stiff, causing you to have a pulse that is faster. If you feel better, you can go back to your normal weight. Hope this helps. Good luck!
